# Coursistant LMS frontend

- **Canonical repo:** https://github.com/picapicaowo-alt/coursistant-lisa
- **App root:** `lms/`
- **Standards doc:** `lms/PROJECT_STANDARDS.md` — read before editing frontend code.

## Do

- Use React 18 + TypeScript (`.ts` / `.tsx`) for all **new** code.
- Route API calls through `src/apis/services/*` and types in `src/apis/types/*`.
- Use TanStack Query for server state; Zustand only for page/workspace UI state.
- Colocate `*.test.ts(x)` with the unit under test.
- Run `npm run typecheck` and `npm run lint` in `lms/` before pushing.

## Do not

- Add new `.jsx` / `.js` source files.
- Point remotes at `bink44/lms-frontend` or personal forks.
- Introduce MUI or other new UI kits.
- Commit QA screenshots (`local-*.png`, `dev-8084-*.png`) unless asked.
- Rewrite legacy chat/profile JSX unless the task explicitly scopes that migration.

## Legacy quarantine

Do not “fix” these for style only — migrate or replace in a dedicated task:

- `src/components/ChatContent.tsx`
- `src/pages/DetailWorkspacePage/**` (v1 assignment shell)
- `src/**/*.jsx` under chat, profile, settings, old roster

Legacy `// @ts-nocheck` files are quarantined until migration — do not expand them.
